WEBVTT

00:01:34.790 --> 00:01:37.140
Wow, what a great, great day!

00:01:37.140 --> 00:01:40.390
Who would have ever thought Lilan-chan would get pregnant?

00:01:43.650 --> 00:01:47.050
Kiriku-sensei's manjuu taste so good.

00:01:48.080 --> 00:01:51.660
You'll upset your stomach if you stuff it full like that.

00:01:54.070 --> 00:01:57.180
Ugh, you just make me lose my words.

00:01:58.280 --> 00:02:03.890
I wonder if they'll give out more tasty stuff to celebrate, not just manjuu.

00:02:03.890 --> 00:02:05.340
I don't think that's possible.

00:02:05.720 --> 00:02:09.760
Finding the money for Eku's food expenses is hard enough right now.

00:02:09.760 --> 00:02:13.400
Lilan's eating more now than before, too.

00:02:14.770 --> 00:02:16.970
I'm going to go check on her!

00:02:17.220 --> 00:02:18.680
Hey, Erin?

00:02:22.240 --> 00:02:24.190
Could Erin...

00:02:24.760 --> 00:02:28.440
have forgotten that the Graduation Trial is coming up?

00:02:28.880 --> 00:02:33.390
Even if Erin's beast-lord gung-ho, that's just not possible!

00:02:35.490 --> 00:02:41.410
Graduation Trial

00:02:44.290 --> 00:02:48.820
We increased her portion the other day and she's still not getting enough?

00:02:48.820 --> 00:02:52.520
Lilan's eating for the baby in her belly, too, right?

00:02:52.520 --> 00:02:53.340
Yeah.

00:02:53.770 --> 00:02:57.820
That means the baby's growing well, right?

00:02:57.820 --> 00:02:59.220
I can't wait.

00:03:02.610 --> 00:03:07.190
But at this rate, <i>our</i> portions might go down.

00:03:09.120 --> 00:03:13.910
For the time being, let's increase the portion of potatoes we mix into their food and see how that goes.

00:03:13.910 --> 00:03:14.660
Right.

00:03:15.130 --> 00:03:17.010
I'll help you, too.

00:03:17.010 --> 00:03:22.260
No.  I'll take care of these, so you go study.

00:03:22.260 --> 00:03:23.870
Eh?  Study?

00:03:24.730 --> 00:03:27.080
You're going to come in first on the graduation trial, right?

00:03:31.630 --> 00:03:33.340
Oh, yeah!

00:03:33.640 --> 00:03:36.010
Don't tell me you forgot about it.

00:03:36.650 --> 00:03:37.980
I had.

00:03:37.980 --> 00:03:40.810
If you don't come in first, you can't stay at Kazalm, you know?

00:03:41.610 --> 00:03:43.430
You want to keep taking care of Lilan, right?

00:03:43.430 --> 00:03:43.810
Then-

00:03:43.830 --> 00:03:45.230
I'll do it!

00:03:46.000 --> 00:03:47.310
Excuse me!

00:03:50.080 --> 00:03:52.150
Beast-lord gung-ho, all right.

00:03:55.250 --> 00:04:03.250
The teachers at Kazalm were discussing if they should report Lilan's pregnancy to the capital or not.

00:04:04.290 --> 00:04:08.620
This isn't something we can keep hidden.

00:04:08.620 --> 00:04:16.090
After Lilan safely delivers the baby, we won't get the money to raise it from the capital if we don't report.

00:04:16.330 --> 00:04:20.680
We're already tight with the budget.  We can't take any more load.

00:04:20.920 --> 00:04:28.150
To get Eku's upkeep fees, we'll need to explain the reason he'll be staying here.

00:04:29.300 --> 00:04:34.110
Okay.  We will report Lilan's pregnancy to the capital.

00:04:35.360 --> 00:04:39.410
However, we will keep Erin out of the picture.

00:04:39.770 --> 00:04:40.810
Is that agreed?

00:04:42.440 --> 00:04:43.660
Yes.

00:04:44.570 --> 00:04:46.370
I'll go to the capital.

00:04:46.940 --> 00:04:50.500
I'll convince those at the Lazal Beast-Lord Care Center.

00:04:51.030 --> 00:04:54.250
Plus, I have an acquaintance at the palace.

00:04:55.590 --> 00:04:56.700
Do you?

00:04:56.700 --> 00:04:58.430
Then please do.

00:05:02.350 --> 00:05:06.810
I wonder what judgment the palace will send down.

00:05:17.110 --> 00:05:19.580
I guess it's time for food soon.

00:05:23.340 --> 00:05:25.200
Lilan, it's time for dinner.

00:05:26.700 --> 00:05:27.580
Lilan!

00:05:30.410 --> 00:05:31.670
What happened?!  That's...

00:05:32.590 --> 00:05:33.960
You threw up?

00:05:36.530 --> 00:05:38.760
What's wrong, Lilan?  Are you not feeling well?

00:05:39.930 --> 00:05:41.770
She's chewing on her tail.

00:05:43.430 --> 00:05:46.140
Stop that, Lilan!  Stop that!

00:05:55.260 --> 00:05:59.840
She had an appetite until this morning, but all of a sudden she stopped eating.

00:05:59.840 --> 00:06:02.380
Was she eating grass by any chance?

00:06:02.380 --> 00:06:05.700
I... don't believe she was.

00:06:08.960 --> 00:06:11.190
She might be suffering from morning sickness.

00:06:11.860 --> 00:06:14.400
Beast-lords have morning sickness, too?

00:06:14.400 --> 00:06:16.880
Was she chewing on her tail because of that, too?

00:06:17.570 --> 00:06:21.970
It's my first experience with a pregnant beast-lord, so there's no way of knowing.

00:06:23.310 --> 00:06:30.420
For a while after becoming pregnant, the body prepares to nurture the new life that's inside of it.

00:06:30.420 --> 00:06:32.560
It's the same for humans and all other animals.

00:06:33.490 --> 00:06:36.610
Try to distract Lilan.

00:06:37.270 --> 00:06:38.060
I will.

00:06:43.000 --> 00:06:44.360
I see.

00:06:44.640 --> 00:06:47.580
That was smart to let her chew on a log.

00:06:48.670 --> 00:06:53.960
If that distracts her, then I don't think she'll chew on her tail.

00:07:00.940 --> 00:07:03.760
Gosh, she broke it!

00:07:04.160 --> 00:07:06.840
I'll go find something much harder.

00:07:07.960 --> 00:07:09.140
Tomura-senpai.

00:07:11.220 --> 00:07:13.040
Thank you very much.

00:07:13.810 --> 00:07:15.310
Yeah, you can count on me.

00:07:24.650 --> 00:07:27.890
Lilan, let's do our best together.

00:07:46.930 --> 00:07:49.420
A beast-lord in labor, huh?

00:07:58.020 --> 00:08:00.820
You can do it!  You can do it!

00:08:10.810 --> 00:08:12.020
The baby!

00:08:12.980 --> 00:08:14.850
Bring me some fresh straw!

00:08:14.850 --> 00:08:15.730
Right!

00:08:28.930 --> 00:08:34.170
Oh, yeah!  I should at least change the straw frequently so the birth can happen at any time.

00:08:57.100 --> 00:08:58.920
Go on in, Eku.

00:09:09.190 --> 00:09:10.310
Looks like you did it.

00:09:10.310 --> 00:09:11.340
Esal-sensei.

00:09:11.750 --> 00:09:16.810
I thought it would be too much to take care of Lilan and Eku at the same time, but I'm impressed.

00:09:17.270 --> 00:09:21.770
It's a great help to have Eku and Lilan in the same shed.

00:09:22.910 --> 00:09:29.030
Watching what Eku does to Lilan, I'm starting to understand what the right things to do are.

00:09:29.530 --> 00:09:31.820
So he's a good teacher.

00:09:31.820 --> 00:09:32.490
Yes.

00:09:37.240 --> 00:09:39.680
Did you notice, Sensei?

00:09:39.680 --> 00:09:45.230
When Lilan's chest turned pink, a sweet scent wafted out.

00:09:52.180 --> 00:09:57.930
Now that you mention it, both Lilan and Eku were sniffing the air.

00:10:01.290 --> 00:10:08.200
Whenever I came back from taking care of Eku, she would keep sniffing me.

00:10:10.100 --> 00:10:14.150
It was around that time when her fur started to turn pink.

00:10:14.150 --> 00:10:20.120
I see.  The scent of an adult male must have triggered estrus.

00:10:21.630 --> 00:10:25.590
But why only Lilan?

00:10:28.050 --> 00:10:34.010
There were three other females out on the field besides Lilan.

00:10:34.010 --> 00:10:36.970
But they showed no interest.

00:10:43.060 --> 00:10:47.440
Capital

00:11:00.360 --> 00:11:03.370
A beast-lord is pregnant?

00:11:04.210 --> 00:11:05.030
Yes.

00:11:06.080 --> 00:11:08.800
The pregnant beast-lord's name is Lilan.

00:11:11.850 --> 00:11:17.220
Lilan is the baby beast-lord I presented to you on your birthday.

00:11:25.970 --> 00:11:28.270
Yes, the baby from then.

00:11:29.040 --> 00:11:32.740
Thank you for the report, Kiriku from Kazalm.

00:11:34.010 --> 00:11:36.800
You may stay at my place for the night.

00:11:36.800 --> 00:11:40.620
Will you tell me some stories of Kazalm?

00:11:42.870 --> 00:11:45.410
Will you, Kiriku?

00:11:46.560 --> 00:11:50.980
Yes.  As you wish, Damiya-sama.

00:12:04.390 --> 00:12:06.350
This is the letter from the palace.

00:12:15.020 --> 00:12:16.280
What does it say?

00:12:19.860 --> 00:12:22.620
These are the words of the Queen:

00:12:23.230 --> 00:12:27.080
"I give my greatest blessing to the pregnancy of the beast-lord.

00:12:27.520 --> 00:12:31.090
To honor the achievement of the Kazalm Beast-Lord Care Center,

00:12:31.480 --> 00:12:35.800
I promise to increase the funding necessary for nurturing them all."

00:12:35.800 --> 00:12:36.300
That's it.

00:12:37.780 --> 00:12:41.190
Great!  What a relief!

00:12:41.190 --> 00:12:42.430
Yes, really.

00:12:43.750 --> 00:12:48.350
The Queen gave her blessing to Lilan's pregnancy?

00:12:49.150 --> 00:12:51.660
That's exactly right, Erin.

00:13:01.120 --> 00:13:08.920
As the graduation trial closed in, the college students studied day and night.

00:13:11.880 --> 00:13:13.260
Pelvis.

00:13:13.260 --> 00:13:15.250
Sacrum.

00:13:15.250 --> 00:13:16.130
Caudal vertebra.

00:13:19.160 --> 00:13:20.750
Urostyle.

00:13:20.750 --> 00:13:22.240
Ischium.

00:13:22.240 --> 00:13:23.970
Phalanges.

00:13:23.970 --> 00:13:25.630
Femur.

00:13:25.630 --> 00:13:27.280
Patella.

00:13:42.280 --> 00:13:43.430
Begin!

00:13:50.280 --> 00:13:54.450
The graduation trial that spans over three days began.

00:13:55.010 --> 00:14:04.220
It was an exam everyone took with uncertainty, but once they started, the time flew.

00:14:08.720 --> 00:14:10.750
All right!  Time's up.

00:14:19.320 --> 00:14:20.720
It's over!

00:14:20.720 --> 00:14:22.930
We're finally free from exams.

00:14:22.930 --> 00:14:24.910
How did you do on the last problem?

00:14:25.200 --> 00:14:28.540
Totally lost it.  I was guessing by the end.

00:14:28.540 --> 00:14:30.040
How did you do, Erin?

00:14:33.040 --> 00:14:35.840
And beast-lord gung-ho is back.

00:14:41.790 --> 00:14:43.630
Does it taste good, Lilan?

00:14:43.630 --> 00:14:46.390
It's meat the Queen sent for you.

00:14:49.390 --> 00:14:50.230
Little girl!

00:14:50.230 --> 00:14:51.430
Erin-chan!
Little girl!

00:14:53.190 --> 00:14:56.110
We're now officially chore boys!

00:14:56.110 --> 00:14:59.110
What?  Weren't you always?

00:14:59.110 --> 00:15:02.190
We were always chore boy trainees.

00:15:02.480 --> 00:15:04.820
We used to be half of a man with us two combined,

00:15:04.820 --> 00:15:06.700
but now we're treated as one man!

00:15:06.700 --> 00:15:08.130
Ehem!

00:15:08.130 --> 00:15:09.140
Ehem!
Ehem!

00:15:09.140 --> 00:15:09.510
Ehem!

00:15:10.380 --> 00:15:13.610
So, how did your trial go?

00:15:13.610 --> 00:15:15.420
You got the pest in class, right?

00:15:15.790 --> 00:15:16.920
"Pest?"

00:15:16.920 --> 00:15:21.050
Ani, you mean "best!"  It means number one.

00:15:21.360 --> 00:15:22.010
Shut up.

00:15:23.420 --> 00:15:28.390
I did everything I could, so I'll scatter my luck to the heavens and wait for the announcement.

00:15:28.640 --> 00:15:36.310
I'm sure you did fine, but if you don't come in first, you could just become a chore girl trainee, so that you can stay here.

00:15:36.330 --> 00:15:37.270
So relax.

00:15:37.270 --> 00:15:41.110
Yeah!  Then we can always be together!

00:15:44.250 --> 00:15:45.530
You're right.

00:15:45.530 --> 00:15:51.280
Chore boy~ Chore boy~

00:15:51.280 --> 00:15:55.370
We're no longer trainees.

00:15:55.370 --> 00:15:56.710
From today on!

00:15:56.710 --> 00:16:01.030
We're chore boys~

00:16:02.460 --> 00:16:05.970
Random chores!  Random chores!  Random chores are fun!

00:16:14.730 --> 00:16:19.190
And so, I will now announce the result of the graduation trial.

00:16:30.140 --> 00:16:31.040
Erin.

00:16:32.060 --> 00:16:32.910
Yes!

00:16:33.660 --> 00:16:35.750
Looks like you struggled with mannerisms.

00:16:40.710 --> 00:16:44.590
But other than that, your grades are excellent.

00:16:45.670 --> 00:16:47.800
Congratulations, Erin.

00:16:47.820 --> 00:16:48.970
You're the valedictorian.

00:16:51.180 --> 00:16:52.770
You did it, Erin!

00:16:52.770 --> 00:16:53.860
Yeah!

00:16:53.860 --> 00:16:55.230
You go!

00:16:56.350 --> 00:16:59.230
And the rest of you have also done very well.

00:16:59.230 --> 00:17:01.040
You all pass.

00:17:01.690 --> 00:17:03.270
Yay!

00:17:03.270 --> 00:17:04.730
Thank goodness!
Yay!

00:17:04.730 --> 00:17:07.700
Yay!

00:17:08.220 --> 00:17:10.040
This is great, Erin!

00:17:10.040 --> 00:17:11.700
Yuuyan!

00:17:17.620 --> 00:17:19.340
Look, Lilan!

00:17:20.390 --> 00:17:22.840
I passed the graduation trial!

00:17:25.130 --> 00:17:27.260
Can you tell how excited I am?

00:17:27.880 --> 00:17:30.300
Now I can stay at Kazalm!

00:17:30.300 --> 00:17:32.640
I can stay with you from now on!

00:17:37.620 --> 00:17:40.790
I'm so glad, Lilan.

00:17:43.600 --> 00:17:45.320
What was that?

00:17:54.230 --> 00:17:55.620
Is that...

00:17:57.810 --> 00:17:58.990
Your baby?

00:18:12.430 --> 00:18:16.720
<i>You used to kick my stomach a lot.</i>

00:18:18.970 --> 00:18:20.600
<i>You were full of energy.</i>

00:18:25.570 --> 00:18:28.220
You're already a mommy now, aren't you?

00:18:49.670 --> 00:18:56.510
The college students who passed the graduation trial left one after another.

00:19:35.010 --> 00:19:39.300
I'll be far away, but I'll never forget about you, Erin!

00:19:40.620 --> 00:19:42.770
Yeah, me neither.

00:19:45.540 --> 00:19:48.110
I'll write letters to you.

00:19:48.110 --> 00:19:53.400
But... I might not find anything else to write about except beast-lords...

00:19:53.400 --> 00:19:56.150
After all, I'm beast-lord gung-ho!

00:19:57.660 --> 00:19:59.740
That's the Erin I know.

00:19:59.740 --> 00:20:03.750
An Erin that's not interested in beast-lords isn't the Erin I know!

00:20:04.200 --> 00:20:05.580
Wow, that's mean!

00:20:53.090 --> 00:20:54.630
Yuuyan!

00:23:29.830 --> 00:23:35.040
The four years at Kazalm Beast-Lord Care Center after she first arrived with Jone,

00:23:36.500 --> 00:23:43.170
through that time, Erin learned valuable lessons.

00:23:44.630 --> 00:23:53.180
And she was beginning to take a firm step toward becoming a teacher.

00:24:01.980 --> 00:24:06.450
At Tamuyuan, the only women who can become teachers are those of high social standing.

00:24:06.470 --> 00:24:08.680
That's what my father told me.

00:24:08.680 --> 00:24:11.280
But that's not true at Kazalm!

00:24:11.280 --> 00:24:15.000
I heard there's a new female teacher who graduated from there.

00:24:15.500 --> 00:24:19.080
I'll study hard so I won't lose to her.

00:24:19.080 --> 00:24:21.460
Then I'm sure father will...

00:24:22.140 --> 00:24:25.000
Kemono no Souja Erin.  Birth.

00:24:25.000 --> 00:26:00.020
Birth
